/// [quickJsBridgeAvailable] probes the exact load path the engine takes
/// (mirroring flutter_js `quickjs/ffi.dart` + `javascriptcore/binding/
/// jsc_ffi.dart`) ONCE per test isolate, so suites can mark engine-dependent
