                  service: widget.service,
                  definition: definition,
                ),
            ],
          ),
        );
      },
    );
  }

  DynamicMessageDefinition? _resolve() {
    final id = _widgetId;
    if (id == null) return null;
    return widget.service.byId(id);
  }

